SUMMARY:All Class Club Ride (Long) CVHS to Strasburg (36R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n***Be Safe\, Have Fun\, a
 nd Ride Together***\n\nThis is the May All Club Ride Long for the A and B 
 rides. Following the ride\, please join us at [Issacs ](https://isaacsrest
 aurants.com/menu/isaacs-craft-kitchen-brewery-04-gf-greenfield-565-greenfi
 eld-road)for food\, drinks and fellowship.\n\nRoute: [https://routes.lanca
 sterbikeclub.net/cue/cv-cvhs-to-strasburg-36r/](https://routes.lancasterbi
 keclub.net/cue/cv-cvhs-to-strasburg-36r/)\n\nThe ride leader will ride at 
 the advertised average speed for the [Ride Classifications](https://lancas
 terbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325156). 
 This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the main goal. 
 The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group together with occas
 ional regroupings and a sweeper may also be appointed at the start.\nPleas
 e do not join this ride if you are not willing to ride with the group. If 
 you exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and encouraged
  to join a faster group. If maintaining the advertised average pace is bey
 ond your current ability level\, please consider joining a slower ride fir
 st.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic r
 epair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate 
 passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and
  Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you ar
 e a club member.\nJoin here [Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.
 net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement t
 o abide by the club's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](https://lancaster
 bikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\nGui
 dance if an incident occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.
 net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3144489
