SUMMARY:Ride the Chester Valley Trail 24 miles F RSVP
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nChester Valley Trail stre
 tches 12 miles between Melvern and the Schuylkill River. This will be a le
 vel and paved ride for its full length. Therefore this will be an easy lei
 sure ride. We will ride from Wegman's parking lot to the Schuylkill River 
 and back. At noon we willstop at Frosty Falls Ice Cream. It should take ar
 ound 3 hours to do. Any type of bike will do for this ride\, since it is p
 aved. We will stop at Wegman’s for a bite to eat when we get back. They 
 have a nice outside patio.\n\nHelmets are mandatory\; No ear buds or audib
 le music playing devices. Please bring water\, and a basic repair kit (spa
 re tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around
  a pen and paper waiver\, we encourage LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP
  below to join this ride. RSVP also allows us to contact you after the rid
 e if needed. If you do not RSVP you are not covered by the club excess acc
 ident insurance policy\; only club members who RSVP are covered. Being on 
 Meetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here- [https://www.lancas
 terbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148](https://www.lancas
 terbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nRichard Conner\
 , leader717-572-8480
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3145945
